2026-05-01¿Spacewave is open-source, private, self-hosted, multiplayer Spaces (apps) that store data wherever you want, work offline through peer-to-peer networking, and sync instantly with real-time streaming multiplayer. v0.51 is the public launch: a suite of first-party Spaces, a plugin SDK to build your own, and desktop, web, and CLI clients, all Apache-2.0 licensed. Try it at spacewave.app in one click with no account required, read the launch announcement, grab the code at github.com/s4wave/spacewave, or join the community on Discord and let us know what you want added next."ŒSpacewave is open-source, private, self-hosted, multiplayer Spaces (apps) that store data wherever you want, work offline through peer-to-peer networking, and sync instantly with real-time streaming multiplayer. v0.51 is the public launch: a suite of first-party Spaces, a plugin SDK to build your own, and desktop, web, and CLI clients, all Apache-2.0 licensed. Try it at [spacewave.app](https://spacewave.app) in one click with no account required, read the [launch announcement](https://spacewave.app/blog/2026/04/launch), grab the code at [github.com/s4wave/spacewave](https://github.com/s4wave/spacewave), or [join the community on Discord](https://discord.gg/KJutMESRsT) and let us know what you want added next.*å
ÉSpaces: shared multiplayer workspaces. Add your friends or coworkers and collaborate live, with role-based access and invite flows.ÉSpaces: shared multiplayer workspaces. Add your friends or coworkers and collaborate live, with role-based access and invite flows.*ñ
àDrive: store and access your files. Drag-and-drop upload, projected downloads, zip export, and live file watching across linked devices.àDrive: store and access your files. Drag-and-drop upload, projected downloads, zip export, and live file watching across linked devices.*‹
lNotes: write and collaborate with Markdown text files. Offline-first, with inline previews and live editing.lNotes: write and collaborate with Markdown text files. Offline-first, with inline previews and live editing.*˙
{Chat: communicate securely with humans or robots. End-to-end encrypted and synced across linked devices, online or offline.{Chat: communicate securely with humans or robots. End-to-end encrypted and synced across linked devices, online or offline.*–
fCanvas: an infinite 2D workspace for visual thinking, with embedded live objects from any other Space.fCanvas: an infinite 2D workspace for visual thinking, with embedded live objects from any other Space.*ÿ
jGit: browse repositories with branches, tags, commit history, and tree views. No clone or terminal needed.jGit: browse repositories with branches, tags, commit history, and tree views. No clone or terminal needed.*§
PMedia: photo gallery and inline image previews wherever files appear in the app.PMedia: photo gallery and inline image previews wherever files appear in the app.*¨
