èCross-platform: desktop apps for macOS, Windows, and Linux, a one-click web app, and a CLI, all built from a single Go and TypeScript codebase.èCross-platform: desktop apps for macOS, Windows, and Linux, a one-click web app, and a CLI, all built from a single Go and TypeScript codebase.*Ë
rAccount and session management: passkeys, account recovery, multi-device session linking, and session self-rejoin.rAccount and session management: passkeys, account recovery, multi-device session linking, and session self-rejoin.*∞
